WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
A light is on over the front door of the simulated property.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:11.000
02:14. A resident reports a possible armed intruder.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:19.000
A courier carries a parcel toward the entrance.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:27.000
A raccoon crosses the planting bed.
